This product includes software and content from the following sources:

- convert/gliner2_export.py is adapted from FluidInference's
  gliner2-5-small-coreml export tooling (Apache-2.0).
  https://github.com/FluidInference/gliner2-5-small-coreml

- The supported GLiNER2.5 model checkpoints (fastino/gliner2.5-small-v1,
  fastino/gliner2.5-base-v1, fastino/gliner2.5-multi-v1) are released under
  Apache-2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/fastino

- Julia 1 (SupersonicLabs/Julia-1, SupersonicLabs/Julia-1-ONNX) is released
  under Apache-2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/SupersonicLabs/Julia-1

- Julia 1 is fine-tuned from mmBERT (jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small), released under
  Apache-2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small

- The GLiNER2.5 encoders are DeBERTa models. DeBERTa is released by
  Microsoft under the MIT license.
  https://github.com/microsoft/DeBERTa

- 500 of the 1000 public test corpus texts (tests/corpus/texts1000.json) and
  the vocabulary-trim corpus (data/trim/corpus.txt) contain strings from the
  argmin learning platform, released under CC-BY-4.0.
  https://github.com/smashburger-dev/argmin (attribution: Noa Katana).

- The WASM fallback module embeds the AssemblyScript runtime
  (Apache-2.0).
  https://github.com/AssemblyScript/assemblyscript
